#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.7.rst:4
msgid "v4.0.7"
msgstr "v4.0.7"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.7.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.0.7 is a maintenance release based on Qt Creator 10.0.1 that fixes a "
"worker-thread crash in device querying and refreshes the bundled ``dfu-"
"util`` flashing tools. There are no breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"v4.0.7 est une version de maintenance basée sur Qt Creator 10.0.1 qui "
"corrige un plantage d'un thread de travail lors de l'interrogation des "
"périphériques et actualise les outils de flashage ``dfu-util`` fournis. Il "
"n'y a aucun changement incompatible."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.7.rst:13
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Sur cette page"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.7.rst:16
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Points forts"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.7.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Worker-thread crash fix** when a DFU or picotool device query failed off "
"the main GUI thread."
msgstr ""
"**Correction d'un plantage d'un thread de travail** lorsqu'une interrogation"
" d'un périphérique DFU ou picotool échouait en dehors du thread principal de"
" l'interface graphique."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.7.rst:20
msgid "**Updated bundled dfu-util** to version 0.10.0 across all platforms."
msgstr ""
"**dfu-util fourni mis à jour** vers la version 0.10.0 sur toutes les "
"plateformes."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.7.rst:23
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Corrections de bogues"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.7.rst:25
msgid ""
"Fixed a crash that occurred when a DFU or ``picotool`` device query failed "
"while running in a worker thread. The ``Query failed!`` message box is now "
"only shown when on the main GUI thread; otherwise an empty device list is "
"returned (`a7f1b7fb7 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a7f1b7fb7>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Correction d'un plantage qui survenait lorsqu'une interrogation d'un "
"périphérique DFU ou ``picotool`` échouait en s'exécutant dans un thread de "
"travail. La boîte de message ``Query failed!`` n'est désormais affichée que "
"sur le thread principal de l'interface graphique ; sinon, une liste de "
"périphériques vide est renvoyée (`a7f1b7fb7 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a7f1b7fb7>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.7.rst:31
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "Prise en charge des plateformes et des outils"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.7.rst:33
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 10.0.1."
msgstr "**Base Qt Creator :** 10.0.1."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.7.rst:34
msgid ""
"**dfu-util** updated to **0.10.0** (bundled ``dfu-util``, ``dfu-prefix``, "
"and ``dfu-suffix`` binaries for arm, linux32, linux64, osx, and windows) "
"(`b2ce1f6f3 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/b2ce1f6f3>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**dfu-util** mis à jour vers la version **0.10.0** (binaires ``dfu-util``, "
"``dfu-prefix`` et ``dfu-suffix`` fournis pour arm, linux32, linux64, osx et "
"windows) (`b2ce1f6f3 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/b2ce1f6f3>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.7.rst:39
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "Changements incompatibles"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.0.7.rst:41
msgid ""
"None. This release is fully compatible with existing projects and workflows."
msgstr ""
"Aucun. Cette version est entièrement compatible avec les projets et les flux"
" de travail existants."
